[TITLE]
NUM-48: closed storage pond SU1 (4000 ft3) with P1 = 100 mg/L and first-order
decay K1 = 24/day (1/h). No flow. KINWAVE, routing step 300 s, 6 h.
Exact answer: 100*exp(-K1*t) = 100*exp(-6) = 0.247875 mg/L at 6 h, whatever
the step (reference manual eq. 5-6 applies exp(-K1*dt) at each step).

